{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03148","headline":"登襄阳岘山 · 张九龄","name":"登襄阳岘山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年亟攀践，征马复来过。\n信若山川旧，谁如岁月何。\n蜀相吟安在，羊公碣已磨。\n令图犹寂寞，嘉会亦蹉跎。\n宛宛樊城岸，悠悠汉水波。\n逶迤春日远，感寄客情多。\n地本原林秀，朝来烟景和。\n同心不同赏，留叹此岩阿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}